application "Blocks Game" is game

model Player
field score is number default 0
that is all

controller Game
action "initialize player"
set player_x to 100
set player_y to 100
that is all

action "move right"
set player_x to player_x plus 20
that is all

action "update world"
set player_y to player_y plus 1
that is all

when application starts
run action "initialize player"
show view "playfield"
that is all

when player presses right
run action "move right"
that is all

when game updates
run action "update world"
that is all
that is all

view "playfield"
fill background with color 18 24 38
draw rectangle at player_x player_y sized 180 by 80 with color 70 170 255
draw rectangle at 400 260 sized 120 by 120 with color 255 110 90
that is all
